Specific commands:
- Hold Left Alt for use Mass Dispel;
- Focus Target for use Power Word:Shield;
- Press Right Shift for use DPS spells + Vampiric Embrace for better healing;

Notes:
- DO NOT TARGET A FRIENDLY PLAYER;

Specific commands:
- Hold Left Alt for use Mass Dispel;
- Left Shift for enabled/disabled Mind Sear (AoE);

Discipline Priest PvP rotation for battlegrounds. Talent build: 57/14/0 (Disc/Holy/Shadow) with Silence, Pain Suppression, Power Infusion, Penance, Inner Focus, Improved PW:S, Reflective Shield, Renewed Hope.

STRATEGY: shield uptime + Penance/Renew rolling, hard-cast Flash Heal for burst, Inner Focus into big heals. Heal Engine picks the ally target (do NOT target friendlies manually). Offensive dispel + Silence pressure the enemy healer via /focus.

DEFENSIVE / SELF-PRESERVATION (auto, in-combat only):
- PvP:Power Word: Shield (Self): keeps PW:S up on you, Weakened Soul aware (no reshield during 6788);
- PvP:Renew (Self): rolling HoT on self &lt; 95% HP;
- D:Pain Suppression (Self): fires at HP &lt;= 50% (40% dmg reduction, 8s, off-GCD);
- H:Desperate Prayer: HP &lt;= 12% panic self-heal;
- PvP:Psychic Scream (Panic): HP &lt; 50% AoE fear peel (8yd);
- PvP:Fade (Snare): drops threat and (with glyph) breaks snares/roots automatically;
- PvP:Power Infusion (Self): self-haste burst at HP &lt; 50% for spam Flash Heal;
- PvP:Hymn of Hope: mana &lt; 20% and HP &gt; 65% (safe to channel).

FOCUS PRESSURE (set /focus on enemy healer or your kill target):
- PvP:Silence (Focus): 5s silence on focus while it casts an interruptible spell (Poly, Heal, Fear, etc.);
- PvP:Mass Dispel (Focus): removes Ice Block / Divine Shield / Cyclone / Hand of Protection / Divine Protection / Dispersion;
- PvP:Dispel Magic (Focus): offensive dispel any Magic buff on focus (Bloodlust, Wings, Icy Veins, NS, Renewed Hope, etc.).

TRINKETS: Use:Trinkets/Hands (PvP) fires gloves tinker + on-use trinkets in combat. PvP medallions (18854/18855/42364/42365/42126/61048) fire only when actually CCed (stun/fear/silence/root).

MANUAL:
- Left Ctrl pauses rotation;
- Left Alt: D:Mass Dispel click-cast (from existing binding);
- do NOT target a friendly player -- Heal Engine picks heal targets;
- keep the enemy healer or focus-swap target as /focus for Silence + Dispel chains.

TEST MODE (dummy testing):
- Enable:  /run PQR_TestMode = true
- Disable: /run PQR_TestMode = nil
- When ON, Silence / Mass Dispel / Dispel Magic (Focus) bypass UnitIsPlayer so they fire on training dummies. Defensive spells still need real damage / low HP / low mana to trigger.
